# ===========================================================================
#  Group Project I - The College Scorecard Dataset
#
#  This repo is for CODE and small STATS. The datasets stay on the group
#  drive / the Scorecard website: the raw files are 60-150 MB each (3.7 GB
#  extracted), which is over GitHub's 100 MB hard file limit, so nothing
#  under data/ is ever committed.
# ===========================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R / RStudio session files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Renviron
.Renviron.*
.Rhistory
.RData
.RDataTmp
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Excel lock files created while a workbook is open (e.g. ~$codebook.xlsx)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Spreadsheets and archives - no reason for either to be versioned here
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.zip
*.7z
*.gz

# ===========================================================================
# RAW DATA - ignored on purpose; this block is the reason this file exists
# ===========================================================================
#   data/College_Scorecard_Raw_Data_06032026/     3.7 GB, 40 CSV files
#       MERGED1996_97_PP.csv ... MERGED2025_26_PP.csv   30 files, ~60-100 MB
#       FieldOfStudyData1415_1516_PP.csv ... (8 files)   ~20-60 MB each
#       Most-Recent-Cohorts-Institution.csv              95 MB / 20.8 M cells
#       Most-Recent-Cohorts-Field-of-Study.csv          146 MB / 40.6 M cells
#   data/College_Scorecard_Raw_Data_06102026.zip    448 MB duplicate download
#   anything else dropped into data/                ignored by the rule below
/data/*

# The one deliberate exception: the official 712 KB codebook. The EDA scripts
# read it to decode coded columns (CONTROL, ICLEVEL, REGION, PREDDEG, LOCALE,
# ...), it is tiny, and partners need it to run anything - so it ships with
# the clone. To exclude data/ with no exceptions at all, delete this line and
# run:  git rm --cached data/CollegeScorecardDataDictionary.xlsx
!/data/CollegeScorecardDataDictionary.xlsx

# ===========================================================================
# EDA/ generated extracts - reproducible and up to 42 MB, so not committed
#   rebuild with:  Rscript EDA/scripts/02_build_simplified_data.R
# ===========================================================================
/EDA/simplified/

# EDA/reports/*.csv, EDA/reports/EDA_SUMMARY.md and EDA/figures/*.png ARE
# tracked on purpose: those are the small tables, stats and figures partners
# need without re-running the analysis.
